 ("15 Copas de Europa","15 European Cups","Es el club con más títulos de la Copa de Europa y la Champions League: 15, desde 1956 hasta 2024. Ninguno se le acerca.","It is the club with the most European Cup and Champions League titles: 15, from 1956 to 2024. No other club comes close."),
