 ("Campeón de Europa en 2016","European champion in 2016","Ganó la Eurocopa de 2016 con Portugal, tras vencer 1-0 a Francia en la prórroga de la final. Con 14 goles es el máximo goleador histórico de la Eurocopa.","He won Euro 2016 with Portugal after a 1-0 extra-time win over France in the final. With 14 goals he is the Euros' all-time top scorer."),
 ("Marcó en cinco Mundiales","Scored at five World Cups","Marcó en cinco Mundiales seguidos (2006, 2010, 2014, 2018 y 2022), algo que nadie había logrado.","He scored at five consecutive World Cups (2006, 2010, 2014, 2018 and 2022), something no one had done before."),
 ("Cinco países","Five countries","Ha jugado en Portugal, Inglaterra, España, Italia y Arabia Saudí, y ha ganado títulos en varios de ellos.","He has played in Portugal, England, Spain, Italy and Saudi Arabia, and has won titles in several of them."),
