 ("Tres grandes torneos seguidos","Three major tournaments in a row","Entre 2008 y 2012 España ganó la Eurocopa, el Mundial 2010 y la Eurocopa de nuevo: tres torneos grandes consecutivos.","Between 2008 and 2012 Spain won the Euros, the 2010 World Cup and the Euros again: three major tournaments in a row."),
