 ("La sorpresa de Grecia","Greece's surprise","En 2004 Grecia ganó la Eurocopa tras vencer 1-0 a Portugal en la final, jugada en Lisboa.","In 2004 Greece won the Euros after beating Portugal 1-0 in the final, played in Lisbon."),
